Title: The Night Nurse
Credit: Cliffcut format test, written for this repo

EPISODE 1

INT. CITY HOSPITAL - NIGHT

Rain against the windows. NORA (28), a night nurse, checks a sleeping patient's drip.

The door opens. VICTOR (40s), expensive suit, steps in without knocking.

VICTOR
(cold)
You were the nurse on duty when my brother died.

NORA
I was. I did everything I could.

VICTOR
Then explain why his will leaves everything to you.

Nora's clipboard falls to the floor.

NORA
(shaken)
I never even spoke to him.

VICTOR
You have until morning to sign it all back to me. Or I tell the police what I found in your locker.

He drops a small glass vial on the bed. It is empty.

NORA
That isn't mine.

VICTOR
(leaning close)
Prove it.

EPISODE 2

INT. CITY HOSPITAL - LOCKER ROOM - NIGHT

Nora tears through her locker. A photo falls out: Nora as a child, held by a man she does not know.

NORA
(whispering)
Dad?

A VOICE (O.S.)
He wanted you to have it all, Nora.

Nora spins around. The patient from the ward stands in the doorway, drip still in his arm.
